      "before": "<div class=\"callout note\"><p><b>Before this page:</b> new to classes? Read <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-oop-from-c\">From C structs to objects</a> (structs become classes), <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-oop-interfaces\">Interfaces</a> (a struct of function pointers with no body) and <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-oop-polymorphism\">Polymorphism &amp; vtables</a> (how <code>override</code> dispatches). Diagrams use UML: <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-uml-class\">class diagrams</a> and the <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-uml-relationships\">arrow legend</a>. Principles: <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-prin-solid\">SOLID</a>. Unknown word? <a href=\"{{BASE}}interview/glossary\">Glossary</a>.</p></div>"
